  "name": "Black Forest Traybake",
  "subtitle": "A chocolate traybake with cherries, chocolate cream, and toasted hazelnuts.",
  "description": "Bake a coffee-and-cocoa sponge, top it with cherry compote and chocolate cream, then finish with whipped cream and hazelnuts.",
